  "verdict": "The 137.9 mm VSYS spine adds 379.0 mOhm + 30.22 nH from South U5 to North U1, plus 380.4 mOhm along SW1_1 to corner LED D1 and 220 mOhm in BQ24073's BAT FET. 3-Phase PWM stagger cuts AC PVCC ripple at U1 from 91.9 mVpp down to 17.0 mVpp! Below VBAT = 3.65 V, full-white GCC=255 pushes North D1's Blue/Green sinks into dropout (causing warm/red color shift on the North half before the South half!). Implementing our derived GCC(VBAT) foldback curve in firmware preserves D65 color balance all the way down to 3.10 V."
